"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4405650","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4234130-1836506165567590","game_id":"steam-4234130","kind":"announcement","title":"Already Added the Demo? Try One Run and Share Your Feedback","summary":"Already added the free demo? Before Steam Next Fest, please try one run and share your feedback. Explore the dark underground maze, find the keys, survive traps and enemies, and tell us what you think. Your feedback will help us improve Lost in the Dark Labyrinth and shape the final version. ːsteamthumbsupːComments are welcome here, or you can send feedback directly to: RFKimmersive@outlook.com Lost in the Dark Labyrinth is scheduled to launch on November 13, 2026.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T10:04:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165567590","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4234130-1835871199306631","game_id":"steam-4234130","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest Is Live – Try the Free Demo","summary":"The free demo for LOST IN THE DARK LABYRINTH is available now during Steam Next Fest.LOST IN THE DARK LABYRINTH is a first-person survival escape game set inside a vast underground maze consumed by darkness.Your objective is simple:Find the hidden keys.Unlock the gates.Avoid deadly traps.Survive relentless enemies.Escape before time runs out.Every corridor may lead you closer to freedom—or deeper into the labyrinth.Resources are limited. Danger waits around every corner. Getting lost can be fata","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T09:58:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199306631","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4234130-1833968530890415","game_id":"steam-4234130","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updated: Improved Survival Feedback","summary":"The demo has been updated with several improvements focused on player feedback and survival awareness.Changes include:• Added a flashing Health Bar when health becomes critically low• Improved visual feedback during dangerous situations• Enhanced player awareness during combat encounters• Various gameplay improvements and fixesThese updates are designed to help players react more effectively when facing threats deep within the labyrinth.Every mistake can bring you closer to death.The free demo i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T08:35:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530890415","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4234130-1825093633186576","game_id":"steam-4234130","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Trailer Updated – Lost in the Dark Labyrinth","summary":"The official trailer for Lost in the Dark Labyrinth has been updated.This new version better captures the atmosphere, tension, and survival horror experience waiting inside the maze.We’ve refined the pacing and opening sequence to more clearly reflect the feeling of isolation and danger that define the game.If you haven’t seen it yet, now is the perfect time to step back into the darkness.Watch the updated trailer on the store page.Wishlist the game if you dare.Your support truly makes a differe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T00:05:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633186576","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_revie